e promotional budget; 99 Food allocates offers and stops spending when the budget is exhausted. The guide describes reporting on promotional orders, revenue, merchant spending, ROI and participating customers, updated the next day.","implication":"Test GoFood merchant promotion automation with explicit budget caps and incremental profit reporting.","nextAction":"Measure incremental orders versus merchant holdouts, contribution after discounts, merchant-funded share and opt-outs.","url":"https://99app.com/99food/restaurantes/guias/oferta-inteligente-voce-define-o-orcamento-a-plataforma-traz-os-pedidos/","source":"99 Food merchant documentation","limitations":"Documentation establishes functionality, not adoption, causal uplift or launch date."},{"id":"ods-editorial-99food-contract-ruling-20260929","date":"2026-09-29","publishedAt":null,"dateBasis":null,"title":"São Paulo court rejects 99 Food clauses naming Keeta; appeal planned","summary":"Bloomberg Línea reports a São Paulo appeals court rejected clauses barring restaurants from working with Keeta. 99 Food disputed the ruling and said it would appeal; the company put affected contracts at 0.1% without disclosing revenue exposure.","implication":"Review merchant incentives for competition constraints before valuing exclusivity as a durable moat.","nextAction":"Check judgment and appeal status; quantify overlap of valuable merchants and review Indonesia-specific rules.","url":"https://www.bloomberglinea.com.br/tech/justica-de-sp-derruba-clausulas-da-99food-que-proibiam-restaurantes-de-atuar-na-keeta/","source":"Bloomberg Línea","limitations":"Brazilian litigation is not Indonesian legal precedent; contract count is not revenue exposure."},{"id":"ods-editorial-99-superapp-20260610","date":"2026-06-10","publishedAt":null,"dateBasis":null,"title":"99 links food relaunch to its Brazilian super-app strategy","summary":"99 describes a Brazilian app combining mobility, food delivery, object delivery and a digital account an